[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m                                   Your apartment, on your futon                                    \u001b[3;5H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m*** SHADE ***\r\u001b[4d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mA brief story by \"Ampe R. Sand\" (Andrew Plotkin)\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "First-time players should type \"about\".\r\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 3 / Serial number 001127 / Inform v6.21 Library 6/10\r\u001b[8dOdd, how the light just makes your apartment gloomier. Pre-dawn darkness pools in the corners and\r\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", "around the tops of walls. Your desk lamp glares yellow, but the shadows only draw your eyes and\r\u001b[10ddeepen.\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "Not much of an apartment, no. One desk, paper-piled, with a dusty computer shoved to the side. Your\r\u001b[13dfuton. Second-hand stereo sitting on a cardboard crate. A kitchen nook one way and a bathroom nook\r\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "the other, with a closet to the side. A broad mirror tries to make the place seem twice its size; it\u001b[15;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "halfway works. One window, whose shade is down, and the front door firmly shut.\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "Your luggage is piled untidily by the door. A potted hyacinth sits beneath the window.\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "You are sprawled on the futon, staring up into that gloom. Your eyes feel gritty. But it's too late\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "-- early -- no time left for sleep, anyway. In a few hours your ride will arrive.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "On the desk are your to-do list and a travel book.\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", ">"]
