[0.091, "o", "t"]
[0.090, "o", "h"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[25dThis plant is your one claim to actual responsibility. The hyacinth sits by the window, soaking up\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "sunlight (when it's not night) and managing to thrive despite your lack of gardening skill. Although\u001b[27;1Hit looks a little parched at the moment.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.413, "o", "s"]
[0.090, "o", "t"]
[0.091, "o", "a"]
[0.090, "o", "n"]
[0.091, "o", "d"]
[0.091, "o", " "]
[0.090, "o", "u"]
[0.091, "o", "p"]
[0.090, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[3M\u001b[1;34H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mYour apartment, in the living room\r\u001b[27d\u001b(B\u001b[mYou lever yourself upright. Umf. It's amazing how much lack of sleep feels like a hangover, only\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "without the preceding party.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.413, "o", "l"]
[0.091, "o", "o"]
[0.090, "o", "o"]
[0.091, "o", "k"]
[0.090, "o", " "]
