[0.090, "o", "r"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[7M\u001b[24dThe far side of the mirror is just as shadowy as this one. It's probably meant as commentary; not\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "more space, just more of the same.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "Come to think of it, as with a hangover, dehydration is probably the problem. Your mouth is dry\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "wool.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.412, "o", "e"]
[0.091, "o", "x"]
