[0.090, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[9M\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "The desk is, of course, an organized mess; overlapping piles of paper, inches high. The computer is\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "a dusty beige block, several generations out of date, poking up hopefully from among the strata. The\u001b[24;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "lamp hangs over all.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.001, "o", "A game-over message is flashing on the screen.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "You see your to-do list and a travel book on the desk.\r\u001b[30d>"]
