[0.090, "o", "o"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[4M\u001b[27dThe stereo is old, dating from the era when matte-black, featureless, and opaque were the watchwords\u001b[28;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "of hipness. It still works, however.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.413, "o", "l"]
[0.090, "o", "o"]
[0.091, "o", "o"]
[0.090, "o", "k"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[12M\u001b[19dYou survey your one small room. One desk, paper-piled, with a dusty computer shoved to the side.\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "Your futon. Second-hand stereo sitting on a cardboard crate. A kitchen nook one way and a bathroom\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "nook the other, with a closet to the side. A broad mirror tries to make the place seem twice its\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "size; it halfway works. One window, whose shade is down, and the front door firmly shut.\r\u001b[24dThe place is still too dim, except the corner where the desk lamp is somehow too bright.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "Your luggage is piled untidily by the door. A potted hyacinth sits beneath the window.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "On the desk are your to-do list and a travel book.\r\u001b[30d>"]
